        "description": "<p>CableOrganizer® is a leading online retailer for cable management, electrical supplies, network products, home theater components, security, tools, and more.<br/><br/>We began operating in 2002 with just a few items in stock and have since grown to offer our customers over 100,000 products. CableOrganizer® is known for our personal touch, excellent customer service, and attention to detail. Our customer service representatives are available to help with orders Monday - Friday, from 9am to 5:00pm EST and are expertly trained in our entire product catalog.<br/><br/>Our online store is a user friendly go-to resource for both professionals and do-it-yourselfers alike, as we are a one-stop-shop for all of your needs.<br/><br/>We cater to a number of different industries, included but not limited to Contractors and Installers, Electricians, Military and Government, Education, IT, Automotive, A/V, and more. We pride ourselves in having the widest selection of the highest-quality products out there. CableOrganizer® - Cable management. Your way. A click away.®</p>",
